R(3,3) = 6, exhaustively over all graphs on 6 and on 5 vertices:
   n=5: graphs with no triangle and no independent 3-set: 12
   n=6: graphs with no triangle and no independent 3-set: 0
   so every 2-colouring on 6 vertices has a monochromatic triangle, and 5 vertices admit one (C_5)

